## What each evaluation costs

| function | cost |
|---|---|
| `golden(params, workload)` | {{cost_golden}} per call |
<!-- arm:waveflow -->
| `pysim(params, workload)` | {{cost_pysim}} per call |
<!-- /arm -->
| `hls_estimate(points)` | {{cost_hls_estimate}}, for each HLS kernel not compiled before at the same sizes |
| `synth(points)` | {{cost_synth}}, for each part not synthesized before at the same sizes |
| `rtlsim(points, workload)` | {{cost_rtlsim_build}} for a design whose RTL is new (plus the synthesis of its new parts); {{cost_rtlsim_run}} for a new workload, or a new value of a parameter that rebuilds no part, on RTL already elaborated |

Up to {{k_workers}} `hls_estimate`, `synth` and `rtlsim` jobs run at once; more wait their turn.

`hls_estimate` covers the HLS kernels: {{hls_kernels}}. The rest of each part (adaptors, memory
windows, the crossbar) is not HLS and has no estimate.
